  Two-Flower and Rincewind's Luggage (from the Discworld) is already
in Nethack.  Got a lot of equipment to move up/down several levels?
Use a troll!

  Trolls will pick up and carry a lot of stuff.  They won't drop it
until they're dead.  No other monsters can get at the loot.  They'll
follow you like a loyal dog.  When you want the loot, kill the troll.
He'll eventually resurrect and you can use him again.  The only
downside is that they're a bit slow.

  I used this method to move the armor, etc. from a barracks up two or
three levels to a general store for price-id and selling.

  When Nethack gives you trolls, use them as self-portable luggage.



